content:
Analyze this lead data and infer personalization context for business email subject lines:

Lead Data:
- Name: {firstname} {lastname}
- Company: {company}
- Title: {designation}
- Industry: {industry}
- Company Size: {company_size}
- City/Country: {city}, {country}
- Lead Type: {lead_type}
- Source: {source}

Infer the following as JSON:
{{
    "industry": "classified industry",
    "persona": "inferred role/persona",
    "pain_points": ["list", "of", "3-5", "pain points"],
    "urgency_level": "low/medium/high",
    "tone_strategy": "appropriate tone",
    "narrative_hint": "brief narrative focus",
    "business_pressure": "main business challenge",
    "messaging_angle": "communication approach"
}}

Focus on business-relevant insights for {language} communication.
